&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical direction of capacity management and workload placement for Datadog&#39;s Kubernetes platform spanning 100,000+ virtual machines across multiple cloud providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build systems that optimize how engineering workloads are scheduled and deployed across regions while balancing capacity constraints, reliability, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across infrastructure teams to evolve multi-region and multi-cloud capacity orchestration as Datadog continues to scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop production software in Go to improve Kubernetes platform capabilities, automation, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and capacity signals to influence infrastructure decisions, forecast growth, and improve workload placement strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
